{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>little boy</strong> who lives in an <strong>atmospheric Soviet communal apartment</strong>. This communal apartment has 5 rooms, a toilet and a kitchen connected by a long corridor. Every time you leave the hallway you find yourself in the kitchen, it seems that there is no way out. Try to find a way to get out of this looping maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch carefully for <strong>anomalies</strong> and clocks in the kitchen, this is the way to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Look into the rooms and look for the keys to open them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock in the kitchen will show you whether you are doing everything right or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think that there is no anomaly, go further down the corridor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uniqueness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>realistic graphics</strong>, close to the real atmosphere in the Soviet communal apartments of the 70s and 80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of objects that you can interact with.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957860?t=1757878004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3957860?t=1757878004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/e3133970b8ec684b5e9b14008cbc386fab8a8c4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757878004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/e3133970b8ec684b5e9b14008cbc386fab8a8c4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757878004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a <strong>little boy</strong> who lives in an <strong>atmospheric Soviet communal apartment</strong>. This communal apartment has 5 rooms, a toilet and a kitchen connected by a long corridor. Every time you leave the hallway you find yourself in the kitchen, it seems that there is no way out. Try to find a way to get out of this looping maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch carefully for <strong>anomalies</strong> and clocks in the kitchen, this is the way to solve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Look into the rooms and look for the keys to open them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clock in the kitchen will show you whether you are doing everything right or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find an anomaly, come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you think that there is no anomaly, go further down the corridor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uniqueness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>realistic graphics</strong>, close to the real atmosphere in the Soviet communal apartments of the 70s and 80s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of objects that you can interact with.</p>","developers":["UUE"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957860/8b9398377cf266d07a5958